{"pageProps":{"source":"Voici comment installer LibreELEC sur un Raspberry PI.\n\nCommencez par [Télécharger LibreELEC](https://libreelec.tv/downloads/raspberry/).\n\n<p>Puis utilisez <a href=\"/etcher\" title=\"Etcher\">Etcher</a> pour le graver sur votre carte SD.</p>\n\n\nOu exécutez la commande suivante :\n\n```bash\n7z x LibreELEC-RPi2.arm-12.0.2.img.gz\nsudo dd if=LibreELEC-RPi2.arm-12.0.2.img of=/dev/sdx status=progress conv=sync\n```\n\nVous pouvez ensuite vous connectez en ssh via la commande :\n\n```bash\nssh root@<ip>\n```\n\nLe mot de passe par défaut est `libreelec`.\n\n***\n\nRéférences :\n\n*   <https://github.com/LibreELEC/LibreELEC.tv>\n","isIndex":false,"url":"https://johackim.com/libreelec","mocs":[{"emoji":"💻","title":"Programmation","permalink":"programmation"},{"emoji":"🧠","title":"Psychologie","permalink":"psychologie"},{"emoji":"🎒","title":"Indie hacker","permalink":"indie-hacker"},{"emoji":"🔮","title":"Obsidian","permalink":"obsidian"},{"emoji":"🐧","title":"Linux","permalink":"linux"},{"emoji":"🐳","title":"Docker","permalink":"docker"},{"emoji":"⚡️","title":"Productivité","permalink":"productivite"},{"emoji":"🥷","title":"Cybersécurité","permalink":"cybersecurite"},{"emoji":"🛡️","title":"Vie privée","permalink":"vie-privee"},{"emoji":"📚","title":"Livres","permalink":"livres"},{"emoji":"🗺️","title":"Modèles mentaux","permalink":"modeles-mentaux"}],"graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"DietPI","title":"DietPI","href":"/dietpi","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Etcher","title":"Etcher","href":"/etcher","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"LibreELEC","title":"LibreELEC","href":"/libreelec","isUnresolved":false}],"links":[{"source":"DietPI","target":"LibreELEC"},{"source":"Etcher","target":"DietPI"},{"source":"LibreELEC","target":"Etcher"}],"activeId":"LibreELEC"},"file":"LibreELEC.md","fileName":"LibreELEC","title":"LibreELEC","description":"Guide d'installation de LibreELEC sur un Raspberry PI","comments":true,"permalink":"libreelec","datePublished":"2021-10-06T16:50","dateUpdated":"2025-06-15T16:50:00","links":"[[Raspberry PI]]","publish":true,"rss":true},"__N_SSG":true}